# Screenshots directory
#
# Place screenshots of the app here (PNG or JPEG). Used by:
# - PWA listing pages (e.g., when distributing via PWABuilder)
# - Play Store listing (upload manually via the Play Console)
# - README / marketing material
#
# Naming convention:
#   home.png         — main medications list
#   alarm.png        — dose alarm modal
#   shopping.png     — pharmacy shopping list
#   logs.png         — consumption log view
#   settings.png     — pharmacy settings
#
# Recommended size: 1080x1920 (portrait) or 1920x1080 (landscape).
